				<h1>General</h1>
				
				<h2>1. Overview</h2>

				<h3>What is iDAL?</h3>
				<p>iDAL is a revolutionary booking platform where verified models and clients connect. Replacing the traditional model agency structure, iDAL allows professional brands, designers and other creatives to connect directly with agency-standard models. The benefits of the old way stand, such as secured payments, safe bookings and a high standard of work, however the iDAL way allows models to manage their own bookings and schedules with the support of a family-like, empowered community. </p> 
				
				<h3>What is iDAL community?</h3>
				<p>At iDAL we are passionate about fostering a community for confident, empowered and independent modelling talent. By hosting monthly events and workshops, we are able to tackle industry-wide issues and provide a safe space for models to connect and support each other.</p> 
				
				<h3>When does iDAL launch?</h3>
				<p>We launch in September 2018. We are currently testing the platform to make it as efficient as possible. </p>
				
				<h3>What can brands do at idal.co now?</h3>
				<p>The platform is already available for private testing for iDAL friends . If you would like to try booking a model with iDAL now, please contact us at hello@idal.co with information about your work, and we will get back to you with the details as soon as possible.</p> 
				<p>We are also building our community, so if you would like to be on the platform and have the first pick of models when we launch, be sure to get in touch. </p>
				
				<h3>What can models do at idal.co now?</h3> 
				<p>Currently we are in testing mode, ensuring that the website and app are as efficient as possible. We are also building our community, so please feel free to support us at our events and spread the word prior to our launch in September so that you can start booking great jobs straight away.</p>
				
