				<h2>2. Security</h2>
				
				<h3>What system-level security measures does iDAL website provide?</h3>
				<p>iDAL has multiple layers of state-of-the-art technology in place to protect sensitive information. Please note that iDAL does not store any credit card information.</p>
				
				<h3>What do I do if an emergency should arise?</h3>
				<p>If you are in immediate danger, call 999. Otherwise, contact us at support@idal.co.</p>
				
				<h3>How do I report suspected vulnerabilities or file a complaint?</h3>
				<p>We take your concerns very seriously and will always listen to any problems that you may have. iDAL is focused on building a nurturing, trusting environment that will always take our models and clients seriously. Please call us, email us or book an appointment to see us if you would like to discuss any concerns. </p>

				<h3>How do I protect the security of my iDAL account?</h3>
				<p>Make sure to use a strong password or passphrase, never share your password with anyone and beware of phishing attempts. iDAL will never ask for your password.</p> 
				
				<h3>Password/Passphrase Guidelines</h3>
				<p>We recommend you use a strong password or passphrase. Strong passwords use a mixture of upper and lower case letters, numbers and punctuation marks. iDAL requires that user passwords are between 6 and 255 characters long. iDAL also supports passphrases (sentences with spaces) in place of passwords.</p> 
				
				<h3>How do I change or reset my password?</h3>
				<p>If you forgot your password, you can request a password reset by selecting “Forgot Password?” on the login screen. Enter the email that you used to create your iDAL profile and further instructions will be sent to your email.</p>
				
				
				<h1>Information for models:</h1>
				
				<h2>1. Referrals</h2>
				
				<h3>I was referred by a friend - what do I do?</h3>
				<p>If you have received a referral code from a friend, please don't forget to enter it when you sign up to iDAL. We trust our existing members and therefore make our decisions regarding their referred friends quicker. However, you still have to fill out all the required information to allow us to review your profile as soon as possible to make you a ‘verified’ model.</p> 
				
